物惊禅定，独未能除是此魔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51256,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"调全玉病二首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"维摩丈室自萧然，病起新凉得恣眠。\n我愧声闻难问疾，想君独对散花天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51257,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贾谊","author":"张耒","text":"贾生未免孝文疑，自古功名叹数奇。\n逐得洛阳年少去，白头绛灌亦何为。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51258,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酒病中寄李十二招饮五首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"酒病岑岑更怯寒，一窗疏雨拥衾眠。\n西风一入庭前树，便有秋声到枕边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51259,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酒病中寄李十二招饮五首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"班郎握笔未封侯，嗜酒扬雄欲白头。\n寂寞著书谁作伴，雨枝风叶碧梧秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51260,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偃王城","author":"张耒","text":"蔓草悲风知几秋，黄桑晚叶野云愁。\n偃王城下樵苏尽，犹有耕人指旧丘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51261,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"张耒","text":"许君踏月夜相过，此语当时恨已多。\n但愿相逢休怨老，不妨白发听新歌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51262,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"张耒","text":"低云著地晓悠悠，雨湿帘旌不上钩。\n江北江南千万里，年年长向此时愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51263,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成二首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"乍晴幽步踏斜阳，残潦青苔曲径荒。\n风掷落花填小堑，雨催芳草上空墙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51264,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成二首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"新引龙孙欲解苞，篱根抽笋已梢梢。\n莓苔雨过蜗缘壁，杨柳叶深莺有巢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51265,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶题二首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"春水长流鸟自飞，偶然相值不相知。\n请君试采中塘藕，若道心空却有丝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51266,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶题二首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"相逢记得画桥头，花似精神柳似柔。\n莫谓无情即无语，春风传意水传愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51267,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"堂前种二桃诗示秬秸","author":"张耒","text":"平昔殷勤向物华，谁知憔悴客天涯。\n双桃栽罢还惆怅，忆得淮阳旧种花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51268,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿文殊院呈孙子和二绝 其一","author":"张耒","text":"天河初没空明星，四听鸡号人欲兴。\n高林有露乍蹄马，佛屋无人到晓灯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51269,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿文殊院呈孙子和二绝 其二","author":"张耒","text":"朱楼帘捲见天涯，倦客倚栏何所思。\n新月无情明复落，清箫有恨歇还吹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51270,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿卢村逆旅","author":"张耒","text":"夜宿村南贫主人，入门桃李已残春。\n无人折赠门前柳，伫立东风独怆神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51271,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿南山普济院","author":"张耒","text":"闪闪青灯照薄帷，幽人不寐自吟诗。\n僧来邀我更深坐，待听山风到树枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51272,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿咸平驿","author":"张耒","text":"萧萧暗叶鸣秋雨，淅淅窗风战客灯。\n世味饱谙心已老，不烦潘鬓强侵陵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51273,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿钱睦甫南斋","author":"张耒","text":"潇洒南轩与病宜，庳床长簟碧纱帏。\n三更月上梦初觉，竹影满窗风入衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51274,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿第四铺","author":"张耒","text":"系缆寒沙伤客情，秋云不动夜阴生。\n萧萧两岸黄榆叶，解报三更雨到声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51275,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿铜陵寺题壁","author":"张耒","text":"僧房秋夜月明天，下马拥裘人悄然。\n老僧何事亦晨起，清磬一声惊客眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51276,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿慈氏院","author":"张耒","text":"楼上鸣钟报五更，朦胧深殿佛灯明。\n更无幽梦随寒枕，听彻风松到晓声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51277,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿潘君草堂闻蛙声二首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"孤村足雨菰蒲合，只有群蛙噪满陂。\n我亦閒来无鼓吹，不烦通夕短长吹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51278,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿潘君草堂闻蛙声二首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"跳踉鼓怒任争雄，何事鸣呼聒睡翁。\n不用洒灰烦鲁老，正须两股付吴侬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51279,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄李不危","author":"张耒","text":"忆昨东风吹马蹄，瓦关分袂涕交挥。\n淮阳风物应如旧，独在柯山送雁归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51280,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄陈州朱教授三首 其三","author":"张耒","text":"春雨江干不肯晴，大江栎岸转雷霆。\n山头方丈浑无事，扫地焚香看佛经。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51281,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄陈州朱教授三首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"欲晓山禽百种鸣，最怜哑咤是雏莺。\n遥想西湖烟柳色，深春风露水边声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51282,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄陈州朱教授三首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"殷勤寄语朱夫子，僧舍花前亦举觞。\n学舍萧条官职冷，不知谁与戴姚黄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51283,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄都下旧友二首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"城西古地昔同游，望月思家相对愁。\n明月秋来应更好，何人看月又悲秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51284,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄都下旧友二首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"一别长安西复东，琵琶旧地已应空。\n当时风景归何处，须信人生是梦中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51285,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"崇化寺三首 其三","author":"张耒","text":"零落宫墙官树秋，行人东去路悠悠。\n祇应楼下邯郸路，亦有离人对此愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51286,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"崇化寺三首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"白发荆州叹滞淫，吴衣重杵洛城砧。\n遣愁莫上高楼望，只有秋来昼日阴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51287,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"崇化寺三首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"楼殿沉沉锁夜烟，秋灯一点佛龛前。\n梧桐叶上三更雨，亦有愁人独自眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51288,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"崇宁壬午临汝四月始闻莺二首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"好音终在耻争先，谷外寒多故后迁。\n已过花时亦何恨，不妨夏木绿参天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51289,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"崇宁壬午临汝四月始闻莺二首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"青杏登盘樱压枝，园林初夏啭黄鹂。\n一声风露高林晓，却觉年华总未衰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51290,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"綵花","author":"张耒","text":"清寒带雪未成春，可得芳菲早向人。\n须遣艳阳归掌握，故教桃李及芳辰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51291,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"悼亡九首 其九","author":"张耒","text":"欲治烦恼更无方，只有头陀理最长。\n不待存亡始知梦，故应交臂已凄凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51292,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"悼亡九首 其八","author":"张耒","text":"嵩阳道出建春门，同入西都四见春。\n谁谓回头隔存没，断肠今作独归人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51293,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"悼亡九首 其七","author":"张耒","text":"山僧老去久忘情，笑我多悲白发生。\n为道人间具烦恼，早来林下共修行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51294,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"悼亡九首 其六","author":"张耒","text":"亦知存没等浮云，鲜笑多悲失道真。\n却恐荒唐齐物叟，鼓盆真是已伤神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51295,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"悼亡九首 其五","author":"张耒","text":"新霜已重菊初残，半死梧桐泣井阑。\n可是神伤即无泪，哭多清血也应乾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51296,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"悼亡九首 其四","author":"张耒","text":"晓梳零乱发星星，病眼昏昏怯夜灯。\n乌几素屏双草屦，百年从此学山僧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51297,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"悼亡九首 其三","author":"张耒","text":"千行垂泪对风烟，万事伤心儿女前。\n晓镜不须催白发，潘郎秋鬓久萧然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51298,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"悼亡九首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"遥夜新霜凋碧槐，三更寒月满堂阶。\n美人化作秋风去，只有清魂梦里来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51299,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"悼亡九首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"菊花还似去年黄，一寸愁心万事伤。\n独立高楼对残日，秋风吹得泪千行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51300,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚归","author":"张耒","text":"学省归来门巷秋，伴眠书史满床头。\n低云漠漠梧桐晚，屏上江山亦解愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51301,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚步灵寿寺后二首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"逢秋种菊尚殷勤，隙地侵寻欲过邻。\n便好采花供服饵，形容已似泽边人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51302,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚步灵寿寺后二首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"秋城草树欲黄昏，微径新晴菜甲新。\n便好灌园从老圃，此怀原是汉阴人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51303,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚春四首 其四","author":"张耒","text":"荒畦零乱满芜菁，春事收功欲老成。\n鹊噪鸠鸣莫无赖，晓枝千啭有雏莺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51304,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚春四首 其三","author":"张耒","text":"洗雨吹风送晚春，尽收红紫布青云。\n眼前消长谙已久，清坐不妨长闭门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51305,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚春四首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"蔷薇倒架笋过邻，梦泽茫茫欲晚春。\n绿暗红稀君莫叹，满枝梅杏欲尝新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51306,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚春四首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"杨柳藏鸦笋作竿，晓风吹雨作轻寒。\n清阴一片收春去，留得蔷薇数点殷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51307,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚春初夏八首 其八","author":"张耒","text":"酴醾压架不胜繁，洗雨吹风更可怜。\n姑射仙人本仙骨，百花凋尽独婵娟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51308,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚春初夏八首 其七","author":"张耒","text":"春归草木漫青红，半委尘埃半逐风。\n谁似长楸百馀尺，高张锦绣照青空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51309,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚春初夏八首 其六","author":"张耒","text":"青春已属明年事，昼漏初知夏景长。\n日日南风笋成竹，残红虽有不成妆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51310,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚春初夏八首 其五","author":"张耒","text":"睡足高檐春日斜，碾声初破小龙茶。\n楼边绿树飞红尽，春色墙阴老荠花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51311,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚春初夏八首 其四","author":"张耒","text":"古柳参天鸣啄木，青芜覆地下鸣鸠。\n白头懒作留春计，睡起移时独倚楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51312,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚春初夏八首 其三","author":"张耒","text":"吹尽成蹊桃李尘，兔葵燕麦一番新。\n只应解箨抽青玉，霜节棱棱尚可人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51313,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚春初夏八首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"少室山前日日风，望嵩楼下水溶溶。\n卷将春色归何处，尽在车前榆荚中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51314,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚春初夏八首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"阴阴夏景变馀春，清晓园林未有尘。\n日日东风欺弱柳，鹅黄吹尽作青云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51315,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚莺二首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"青竹万叶一霜摧，何事流莺去复回。\n啼鵊已摧芳草歇，春风安肯为君来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51316,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚莺二首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"庭树知秋彫晚枝，春莺一去几时归。\n晚来何事枝头见，哑咤数声还复飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51317,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晨起二首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"中宵爽气入衾裯，檐雨浪浪晓末收。\n三伏炎歊扫除尽，待教明月放清秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51318,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梁冀","author":"张耒","text":"力回汉鼎未收功，又道将军世上雄。\n不悟折腰同龋齿，百般装束为秦宫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51319,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅","author":"张耒","text":"覆釜湖边雪压尘，数枝林外已先春。\n尽将七泽清霜气，洗出姑山绰约身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51320,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花","author":"张耒","text":"我爱梅花不忍摘，清香却解逐人来。\n风露肌肤随处好，不知人世有尘埃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51321,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花二首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"天质自清非为瘦，仙姿正白不施红。\n未开如怨开如笑，枉乞幽香与北风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51322,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花二首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"便使柳肥终解舞，莫惊梅瘦为含酸。\n因风自袅还成态，与雪争妍却要寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51323,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花七绝 其五","author":"陈师道","text":"任教雪压色终胜，却要风严香更闻。\n江雨细时青子熟，闻名犹救渴将军。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51324,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花 其五","author":"张耒","text":"脉脉无言亦有期，雪中狂杀羽林儿。\n可怜多少幽奇事，却是东风总不知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51325,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花 其四","author":"张耒","text":"清寒池馆静无尘，岁岁相逢似故人。\n任遣墙头疑是雪，欲教园木早知春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51326,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花 其三","author":"张耒","text":"玉粟匀圆官样黄，领巾借与十分香。\n冲寒不为生春物，自要晨霜为洗妆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51327,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花 其二","author":"张耒","text":"林外啼禽自往还，风前诗客倚阑干。\n小园门锁黄昏月，耿耿幽姿伴岁寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51328,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]